{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p (be aware of numerics).\"\"\"\n\n    def _pow_mod(base: int, exp: int, mod: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper for modular exponentiation (base^exp % mod) using exponentiation by squaring.\"\"\"\n        result = 1\n        base %= mod # Reduce base modulo mod in case base >= mod\n        while exp > 0:\n            if exp & 1:  # If exp is odd\n                result = (result * base) % mod\n            base = (base * base) % mod\n            exp >>= 1  # exp = exp // 2\n        return result\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    return _pow_mod(2, n, p)"}
